OL,3,ACleverly quits shadow cabinet to run
OL,4,Afor London mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe capital is not set to vote on a new
OL,7,Fmayor until May 2028. Labour incumbent
OL,8,FSir Sadiq Khan is yet to confirm
OL,9,Fwhether he will seek an unprecedented
OL,10,Ffourth term.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/37
